cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the register history it records, please cite it as below."
title: "MiCAR Register Observatory"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Förste"
    given-names: "Sebastian"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastianfoerste/micar-register-observatory"
abstract: >-
  Weekly snapshots and diffs of the five ESMA interim MiCAR register exports
  (Title II, e-money token and asset-referenced token white papers, authorised
  crypto-asset service providers and non-compliant entities) since 7 July 2026,
  with a changelog of every recorded change.
keywords:
  - MiCAR
  - MiCA
  - ESMA
  - crypto-assets
  - regulatory data
  - register history
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-07
